ProtocolFeeCollector::setFlashMinter
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new flash minter is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when new flash minter equals the current flash minter
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new flash minter is valid and different
        ├── it should update flashMinter
        └── it should emit FlashMinterUpdated
